    * Martijn Voncken <mvoncken@gmail.com>
    * Mark Stahler ('kramed') <markstahler@gmail.com>
    * Pedro Algarvio ('s0undt3ch') <ufs@ufsoft.org>
    * Cristian Greco ('cgreco') <cristian@regolo.cc>
    * Chase Sterling ('gazpachoKing') <chase.sterling@gmail.com>

Plugin authors. The plugins are gone as plugins, but four of them are now
features of the daemon and were written from these designs:
    * AutoAdd   : Chase Sterling
    * Blocklist : John Garland
    * Label     : Martijn Voncken
    * Scheduler : Andrew Resch

Deluge's own translators are credited in the upstream AUTHORS file. redeluge
ships no translations, so that list is not reproduced here.


libtorrent
----------
    * Arvid Norberg and contributors, https://libtorrent.org
    license: BSD 3-Clause

redeluge links libtorrent-rasterbar; it does not include its source.


Bundled front end
-----------------
The files under crates/redeluge-web/assets/ are served to the browser and are
compiled into the redeluge-web binary.

    * files: js/extjs/ext-all*.js, ext-base*.js, themes/**
      copyright: Sencha Inc. (Ext JS 3.4.0)
      license: GPLv3
      url: https://www.sencha.com/legal/gpl/

    * files: js/deluge-all/**, js/extjs/ext-extensions/**, css/**
      copyright: the Deluge authors above
      license: GPLv3

    * files: icons/active.png, alert.png, all.png, checking.png, dht.png,
             downloading.png, inactive.png, queued.png, seeding.png,
             traffic.png, deluge*.png
      copyright: Calum Lind
      license: GPLv3

    * files: icons/*.png, except those listed above and apple-pre-*.png
      copyright: Yusuke Kamiyamane <p@yusukekamiyamane.com>
      license: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0
      url: http://p.yusukekamiyamane.com/

    * files: images/spinner.gif, spinner-split.gif
      copyright: Steven Chim
      license: BSD
      url: http://members.upc.nl/j.chim/ext/spinner2/ext-spinner.html
